    "type": "game",
    "name": "Satan's Dungeon",
    "steam_appid": 3437110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are our choices truly our own, or merely the illusion of freedom on a predetermined course? And if free will is only an illusion, then what meaning remains for sin and virtue?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Satan's Dungeon is a first-Person philosophical horror</strong> \u2013 Explore, solve puzzles, escape enemies, and uncover <strong>five interconnected endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/cd93d1426dba09f1201c377e1ea58fde.poster.avif?t=1741633493\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/cd93d1426dba09f1201c377e1ea58fde.webm?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/cd93d1426dba09f1201c377e1ea58fde.mp4?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie world of <i>Satan's Dungeon</i>, a first-person horror game that blends psychological terror with intricate puzzles and a <strong>non-linear narrative</strong>. You begin your journey exploring an abandoned tunnel in search of a legendary treasure, only to stumble upon a mysterious mirror. The moment you touch it, you are transported into a sinister dungeon\u2014trapped, with no clear way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/0a95b8b4c706238a98b747070700de4d.poster.avif?t=1741633493\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/0a95b8b4c706238a98b747070700de4d.webm?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/0a95b8b4c706238a98b747070700de4d.mp4?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, a cryptic voice guides you, urging you to solve complex puzzles and evade terrifying enemies. The gameplay is <strong>dynamic and ever-changing</strong>, with mirrors allowing you to witness the memories of those who were trapped before you. These glimpses into the past not only provide valuable items but also unravel the dungeon\u2019s dark and twisted history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/98165fef8d9fa90b8cb2b6e12da0ada4.poster.avif?t=1741633493\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/98165fef8d9fa90b8cb2b6e12da0ada4.webm?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/98165fef8d9fa90b8cb2b6e12da0ada4.mp4?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here\u2019s what makes <i>Satan\u2019s Dungeon</i> truly unique: <strong>The story unfolds non-linearly, and each ending is a piece of a larger puzzle. Every ending builds upon the previous one, revealing new layers of meaning and altering the game world itself.</strong> To fully understand the complete story and grasp the true significance of each conclusion, you must experience all five endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/45f183414f6334af31e69e9e34f81c86.poster.avif?t=1741633493\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/45f183414f6334af31e69e9e34f81c86.webm?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/45f183414f6334af31e69e9e34f81c86.mp4?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique psychological horror experience</strong> with an unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging and complex puzzles</strong> that test your logic and perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A non-linear storytelling approach</strong>, where choices and actions reshape the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirrors that connect you to the memories of past prisoners</strong>, revealing vital secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five interconnected endings</strong>, each expanding the narrative and changing the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/a81a4d5c1e4e0d89c243c3e244aebb38.poster.avif?t=1741633493\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/a81a4d5c1e4e0d89c243c3e244aebb38.webm?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437110/extras/a81a4d5c1e4e0d89c243c3e244aebb38.mp4?t=1741633493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to enter <i>Satan's Dungeon</i> and uncover the truth hidden within?</p>",
